{
 "about": "Rouge's face map. OUAK's code shows a face by turning 23 objects on and off (its face component, MainGameOujiFace), one face group per motion row. Rouge's new style has a piece for each of the 23 slots, named as the slot, and no extra: every group shows the pieces the game names. There is no old style. The OUAK slots and groups are the same as in Burda's map. All mappings are mine; nobody has seen them in the game.",
